"\n<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"6\" r=\"4\"></circle><text x=\"6\" y=\"8.6\" font-size=\"6\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"18\" r=\"4\"></circle><text x=\"6\" y=\"20.6\" font-size=\"6\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"6\" r=\"4\"></circle><text x=\"18\" y=\"8.6\" font-size=\"6\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Lektion</div><div class=\"lk-big\">07</div><h1>수와 시간</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Zahlen, Datum und Uhrzeit</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">숫자는 가격·전화번호·시각·날짜에 늘 필요해요.<br>0부터 12까지와 십의 자리만 외우면 나머지는 조합으로 만들어요 — 21은 '하나 그리고 스물', einundzwanzig.<br>이 과에서는 기수와 서수, 연도와 날짜, 시각, 그리고 시간을 나타내는 전치사를 정리해요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 과에서 익힐 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">0부터 백만까지 기수를 읽고 써요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">연도를 읽어요 — 1990과 2026은 읽는 방식이 달라요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">서수를 만들어 날짜를 말해요 — am dritten Mai</div><div class=\"x-goal\">공식 시각과 일상 시각을 말해요 — halb drei는 2시 30분</div><div class=\"x-goal\">시간 전치사 um·am·im·in·vor·nach·seit·ab·bis를 골라요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">가격·소수·분수·전화번호를 읽어요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">복습</span><span class=\"sub-title\">4–6과 복습</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Heute ____ ich Deutsch.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) lernt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) lernen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) lerne</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) lernst</button></div><div class=\"qe\">첫 자리 Heute → 동사 두 번째 → 주어, ich → lerne (5·6과).</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> ____ kommen Sie? — Aus Korea.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Woher</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Wann</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Wo</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Wohin</button></div><div class=\"qe\">온 곳 → woher (6과).</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Kannst du ____ helfen? <span class=\"qh\">그를</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) er</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) sein</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) ihn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) ihm</button></div><div class=\"qe\">helfen + 3격 → ihm (4과).</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Er ____ ein Taxi. <span class=\"qh\">nehmen</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) nehmt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) nimmt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) nimmst</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) nehme</button></div><div class=\"qe\">nehmen → er nimmt (5과).</div></div></div>\n<section id=\"sec-A\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">A</span><h2>한국어로 먼저 보기</h2></div><p>한국어 '스물하나'는 큰 자리부터 읽어요 — 스물(20) + 하나(1).<br>독일어는 21 이상에서 일의 자리를 먼저 읽어요 — ein·und·zwanzig, '하나 그리고 스물'.<br>시각도 다르게 말해요. 한국어 '두 시 반'을 독일어는 '세 시를 향해 절반', halb drei라고 해요.</p><div class=\"dgm\"><div class=\"dgm-cap\">순서가 거꾸로인 두 가지</div><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>한국어</th><th>독일어</th><th>독일어 순서</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>스물하나 (21)</td><td>einundzwanzig</td><td>1 + und + 20</td></tr><tr><td>서른다섯 (35)</td><td>fünfunddreißig</td><td>5 + und + 30</td></tr><tr><td>아흔아홉 (99)</td><td>neunundneunzig</td><td>9 + und + 90</td></tr><tr><td>두 시 반 (2:30)</td><td>halb drei</td><td>3시까지 절반</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"dgm-note\">숫자 전체는 한 단어로 붙여 써요 — einundzwanzig, zweihundertfünfunddreißig.</div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-B\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">B</span><h2>기수 0–99</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">21부터 99까지는 일의 자리를 먼저 말해요. 21은 '하나와 스물'이라는 뜻으로 <strong>ein</strong>und<strong>zwanzig</strong>예요.</p></div></div><h3>0–12 — 그냥 외워요</h3><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>수</th><th>독일어</th><th>수</th><th>독일어</th><th>수</th><th>독일어</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>0</td><td>null</td><td>5</td><td>fünf</td><td>10</td><td>zehn</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>eins</td><td>6</td><td>sechs</td><td>11</td><td>elf</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>zwei</td><td>7</td><td>sieben</td><td>12</td><td>zwölf</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>drei</td><td>8</td><td>acht</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>vier</td><td>9</td><td>neun</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>13–19 — 일의 자리 + zehn</h3><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>수</th><th>독일어</th><th>주의</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>13</td><td>dreizehn</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>vierzehn</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>fünfzehn</td></tr><tr><td>16</td><td>sech<span class=\"x-e\">zehn</span></td><td>sechs의 s가 빠져요</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>sieb<span class=\"x-e\">zehn</span></td><td>sieben의 en이 빠져요</td></tr><tr><td>18</td><td>achtzehn</td></tr><tr><td>19</td><td>neunzehn</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>20–90 — 일의 자리 + zig</h3><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>수</th><th>독일어</th><th>수</th><th>독일어</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>20</td><td><span class=\"x-e\">zwanzig</span></td><td>60</td><td>sech<span class=\"x-e\">zig</span></td></tr><tr><td>30</td><td>drei<span class=\"x-e\">ßig</span></td><td>70</td><td>sieb<span class=\"x-e\">zig</span></td></tr><tr><td>40</td><td>vierzig</td><td>80</td><td>achtzig</td></tr><tr><td>50</td><td>fünfzig</td><td>90</td><td>neunzig</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"dgm-note\">20 zwanzig과 30 dreißig(-ßig)은 모양이 특별하고, 60·70은 13–19와 똑같이 s와 en이 빠져요.</div><h3>21–99 — 일의 자리 + und + 십의 자리</h3><div class=\"dgm\"><div class=\"dgm-cap\">일의 자리를 먼저 읽고, 한 단어로 붙여요</div><div class=\"exl\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">21 → <strong>ein</strong>undzwanzig</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">eins의 s가 빠져요</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">34 → vierunddreißig</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">57 → siebenundfünfzig</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">68 → achtundsechzig</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">99 → neunundneunzig</span></div></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">eins · ein · eine</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">숫자를 셀 때는 eins(하나), und 앞에서는 ein(einundzwanzig), <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">명사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">명사</span>사람·동물·물건·장소·생각의 이름이 되는 말이에요. 독일어 명사는 첫 글자를 대문자로 써요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: der Tisch 책상 · die Liebe 사랑</span></span></span> 앞에서는 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">관사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">관사</span>명사 앞에 붙어 그 명사의 성·수·격과, 정해진 대상인지 아닌지를 나타내는 말이에요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: der Hund 그 개 · ein Hund 개 한 마리</span></span></span>처럼 ein·eine(ein Kind · eine Stunde)이에요.<br>전화로 숫자를 불러 줄 때는 drei와 헷갈리지 않게 zwei를 zwo라고 하기도 해요.</p></div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기수 0–99</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> 17은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) siebenzig</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) siebzehn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) siebzig</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) siebenzehn</button></div><div class=\"qe\">sieben의 en이 빠져요.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> 30은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) dreizehn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) dreisig</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) dreizig</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) dreißig</button></div><div class=\"qe\">30만 -ßig이에요.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> 45는?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) vierundfünfzig</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) vierzigfünf</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) fünfundvierzig</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) fünfvierzig</button></div><div class=\"qe\">일의 자리(5) + und + 십의 자리(40).</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> 61은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) einundsechszig</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) sechzigeins</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) einsundsechzig</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) einundsechzig</button></div><div class=\"qe\">eins는 und 앞에서 ein, 60은 sechzig.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> achtundsiebzig은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) 708</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) 78</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) 18</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) 87</button></div><div class=\"qe\">acht(8) + und + siebzig(70).</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-C\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">C</span><h2>100 이상과 연도</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">큰 수는 한 단어로 붙여 써요. 연도 1998은 '십구백구십팔'처럼 neunzehnhundertachtundneunzig로 읽어요.</p></div></div><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left\"><thead><tr><th>수</th><th>독일어</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>100</td><td>(ein)hundert</td></tr><tr><td>101</td><td>hunderteins</td></tr><tr><td>256</td><td>zweihundertsechsundfünfzig</td></tr><tr><td>1.000</td><td>(ein)tausend</td></tr><tr><td>1.200</td><td>(ein)tausendzweihundert</td></tr><tr><td>2.026</td><td>zweitausendsechsundzwanzig</td></tr><tr><td>10.000</td><td>zehntausend</td></tr><tr><td>1.000.000</td><td>eine Million</td></tr><tr><td>2.000.000</td><td>zwei Millionen</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"callout callout-key\"><span class=\"co-badge \">점과 쉼표</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">독일어는 천 단위를 점(.)으로, 소수점을 쉼표(,)로 써요 — 1.000 천 · 2,5 이 점 오.<br>한국어·영어와 반대라서 가격과 통계를 읽을 때 조심해요.</p></div></div><h3>연도 읽기</h3><p>1100년부터 1999년까지는 백 단위로 읽어요. 2000년부터는 보통 수처럼 읽어요.</p><div class=\"exl\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">1990 → neunzehnhundertneunzig</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">19 + hundert + 90</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">1848 → achtzehnhundertachtundvierzig</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">2000 → zweitausend</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">2026 → zweitausendsechsundzwanzig</span></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-warn\"><span class=\"co-badge co-warn\">연도 앞에 in을 쓰지 않아요</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">'2026년에'는 2026 또는 im Jahr 2026이에요. 영어 in 2026을 옮긴 in 2026은 쓰지 않아요.</p></div></div><div class=\"exl\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Ich bin <strong>1998</strong> geboren.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">저는 1998년에 태어났어요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Im Jahr 2030</strong> gibt es neue Regeln.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">2030년에는 새 규칙이 생겨요.</span></div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">100 이상과 연도</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> 1.500(수량)은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) (ein)tausendfünfhundert</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) tausendfünfzig</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) fünfzehnhundert Komma</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) einshundertfünfzig</button></div><div class=\"qe\">수량은 천 단위로 읽어요.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> 연도 1985는?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) neunzehnhundertfünfundachtzig</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) neunzehnhundertachtundfünfzig</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) neunzehnachtzigfünf</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) eintausendneunhundertfünfundachtzig</button></div><div class=\"qe\">1100–1999년은 백 단위로 읽어요.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> '나는 2005년에 태어났어요.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Ich bin in 2005 geboren.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Ich bin um 2005 geboren.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Ich bin 2005 geboren.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Ich bin am 2005 geboren.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">연도 앞에는 전치사를 쓰지 않아요.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> 독일어 표기 3,75는?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) 3,075</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) 3천 750</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) 3과 4분의 3 (3.75)</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) 375</button></div><div class=\"qe\">쉼표는 소수점이에요.</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-D\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">D</span><h2>서수 — 순서를 나타내는 수</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">'첫째·둘째' 같은 순서는 대부분 수 뒤에 -te, 20부터는 -ste를 붙여요 — der zwei<strong>te</strong> · der zwanzig<strong>ste</strong>.</p></div></div><p>'첫째, 둘째'처럼 순서를 나타내는 수예요. 숫자 뒤에 점을 찍어 써요 — 1. = erste, 3. = dritte.</p><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left\"><thead><tr><th>범위</th><th>만드는 법</th><th>예</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1.–19.</td><td>기수 + -te</td><td>zweite · vierte · fünfte · zehnte · neunzehnte</td></tr><tr><td>20. 이상</td><td>기수 + -ste</td><td>zwanzigste · einundzwanzigste · hundertste</td></tr><tr><td>불규칙</td><td>따로 외워요</td><td><strong>erste</strong>(1.) · <strong>dritte</strong>(3.) · <strong>siebte</strong>(7.) · <strong>achte</strong>(8.)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"callout callout-key\"><span class=\"co-badge \">서수에는 어미가 붙어요</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\"><span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">서수<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">서수</span>순서를 나타내는 수예요. 형용사처럼 어미가 붙어요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: der erste Tag · am dritten Mai</span></span></span>는 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">형용사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">형용사</span>사람이나 사물이 어떤지를 나타내는 말이에요. 명사 앞에서는 어미가 붙어요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Das Buch ist gut. · das gute Buch</span></span></span>처럼 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">명사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">명사</span>사람·동물·물건·장소·생각의 이름이 되는 말이에요. 독일어 명사는 첫 글자를 대문자로 써요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: der Tisch 책상 · die Liebe 사랑</span></span></span> 앞에서 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">어미<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">어미</span>단어 끝에 붙어 문법 정보를 나타내는 부분이에요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: lern-e · gut-er · Kind-er</span></span></span>가 붙어요(23과).<br>지금은 두 가지만 기억해요 — der·die·das 뒤에서는 -e, am·im·zum 뒤에서는 -en.<br>der dritt<span class=\"x-e\">e</span> Mai · am dritt<span class=\"x-e\">en</span> Mai · im zweit<span class=\"x-e\">en</span> Stock</p></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-E\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">E</span><h2>날짜 — 요일·달·날짜</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">날짜는 순서를 나타내는 수(<span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">서수<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">서수</span>순서를 나타내는 수예요. 형용사처럼 어미가 붙어요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: der erste Tag · am dritten Mai</span></span></span>)로 말해요. '5월 3일에'는 am dritten Mai예요.</p></div></div><p>요일과 달은 모두 남성이에요(1과).</p><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>요일</th><th>달</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Montag 월 · Dienstag 화 · Mittwoch 수</td><td>Januar · Februar · März · April</td></tr><tr><td>Donnerstag 목 · Freitag 금</td><td>Mai · Juni · Juli · August</td></tr><tr><td>Samstag 토 · Sonntag 일</td><td>September · Oktober · November · Dezember</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>오늘이 며칠인지 말하기</h3><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left\"><thead><tr><th>묻는 말</th><th>대답</th><th>격</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Der Wievielte ist heute?<span class=\"tc-ko\">오늘 며칠이에요?</span></td><td>Heute ist <strong>der dritte</strong> Mai.</td><td>1격 → -e</td></tr><tr><td>Welches Datum haben wir heute?</td><td>Wir haben <strong>den dritten</strong> Mai.</td><td>4격 → -en</td></tr><tr><td>Wann hast du Geburtstag?<span class=\"tc-ko\">생일이 언제야?</span></td><td><strong>Am dritten</strong> Mai.</td><td>am → -en</td></tr><tr><td>Vom wievielten bis zum wievielten?</td><td><strong>Vom ersten bis zum fünften</strong> Juni.</td><td>vom·zum → -en</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">날짜 쓰기</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">3. Mai 2026 · 03.05.2026 — 날짜·달·연도 순서이고 숫자 뒤에 점을 찍어요.<br>편지 맨 위에는 Seoul, den 3. Mai 2026처럼 써요(<span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">4격<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">4격</span>주로 '~을/를'을 나타내는 자리예요. 동작을 받는 대상이고, für·ohne 같은 전치사 뒤에도 와요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Ich sehe den Mann. 그 남자를 봐요.</span></span></span> den dritten).</p></div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">서수와 날짜</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> 3.의 서수는?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) dritte</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) dreiste</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) drittste</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) dreite</button></div><div class=\"qe\">3.은 불규칙 dritte.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> 20.의 서수는?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) zwanzigte</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) zwanzigtste</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) zwanzigerste</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) zwanzigste</button></div><div class=\"qe\">20 이상은 -ste.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Mein Geburtstag ist ____ Juli. <span class=\"qh\">7월 1일에</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) im ersten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) am ersten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) am eins</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) am erste</button></div><div class=\"qe\">am + 서수 -en.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Heute ist ____ Oktober. <span class=\"qh\">10월 7일</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) der siebte</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) am siebten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) der siebente</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) den siebte</button></div><div class=\"qe\">1격 der + -e, 7.은 siebte.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> '5월 3일부터 5월 10일까지'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) am dritten bis am zehnten Mai</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) von dritte bis zehnte Mai</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) vom drei bis zum zehn Mai</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) vom dritten bis zum zehnten Mai</button></div><div class=\"qe\">vom·zum + 서수 -en.</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-F\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">F</span><h2>시각 — 공식 시각과 일상 시각</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">공식 시각은 숫자대로 읽고, 일상에서는 halb·Viertel로 말해요. halb drei는 3시 30분이 아니라 2시 30분이에요.</p></div></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" alt=\"Es ist halb drei. 2시 30분이에요.\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><div><span class=\"ph-de\">Es ist <strong>halb drei</strong>.</span><span class=\"ph-ko\">2시 30분이에요.</span></div></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"fig\"><div class=\"fig-scroll\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 290\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"일상 시각 — 30분까지는 nach, 30분은 halb, 그 뒤는 vor\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><defs><marker id=\"clock-ink\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mki\"/></marker><marker id=\"clock-acc\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mka\"/></marker><marker id=\"clock-ok\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mko\"/></marker><marker id=\"clock-no\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mkn\"/></marker><marker id=\"clock-w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mkw\"/></marker></defs><path d=\"M140,140 L140,28 A112,112 0 0 1 140,252 Z\" class=\"f-boxa\"/><path d=\"M140,140 L140,252 A112,112 0 0 1 140,28 Z\" class=\"f-boxw\"/><circle cx=\"140.0\" cy=\"140.0\" r=\"112.0\" class=\"f-ring\"/><line x1=\"140.0\" y1=\"38.0\" x2=\"140.0\" y2=\"28.0\" class=\"f-ln\"/><line x1=\"191.0\" y1=\"51.7\" x2=\"196.0\" y2=\"43.0\" class=\"f-ln\"/><line x1=\"228.3\" y1=\"89.0\" x2=\"237.0\" y2=\"84.0\" class=\"f-ln\"/><line x1=\"242.0\" y1=\"140.0\" x2=\"252.0\" y2=\"140.0\" class=\"f-ln\"/><line x1=\"228.3\" y1=\"191.0\" x2=\"237.0\" y2=\"196.0\" class=\"f-ln\"/><line x1=\"191.0\" y1=\"228.3\" x2=\"196.0\" y2=\"237.0\" class=\"f-ln\"/><line x1=\"140.0\" y1=\"242.0\" x2=\"140.0\" y2=\"252.0\" class=\"f-ln\"/><line x1=\"89.0\" y1=\"228.3\" x2=\"84.0\" y2=\"237.0\" class=\"f-ln\"/><line x1=\"51.7\" y1=\"191.0\" x2=\"43.0\" y2=\"196.0\" class=\"f-ln\"/><line x1=\"38.0\" y1=\"140.0\" x2=\"28.0\" y2=\"140.0\" class=\"f-ln\"/><line x1=\"51.7\" y1=\"89.0\" x2=\"43.0\" y2=\"84.0\" class=\"f-ln\"/><line x1=\"89.0\" y1=\"51.7\" x2=\"84.0\" y2=\"43.0\" class=\"f-ln\"/><text x=\"140.0\" y=\"56.0\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-m\" font-weight=\"700\">12</text><text x=\"228.0\" y=\"146.0\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-m\" font-weight=\"700\">3</text><text x=\"140.0\" y=\"236.0\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-m\" font-weight=\"700\">6</text><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"146.0\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-m\" font-weight=\"700\">9</text><text x=\"190.0\" y=\"146.0\" font-size=\"21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-a\" font-weight=\"700\">nach</text><text x=\"90.0\" y=\"146.0\" font-size=\"21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-wt\" font-weight=\"700\">vor</text><text x=\"140.0\" y=\"280.0\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\" font-weight=\"700\">6 = halb + 다음 시</text><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"34.0\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-m\" font-weight=\"700\">2시 무렵</text><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"72.0\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-m\" font-weight=\"700\">2:10</text><text x=\"358.0\" y=\"72.0\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-t\">zehn <tspan font-weight=\"700\">nach</tspan> zwei</text><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"110.0\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-m\" font-weight=\"700\">2:15</text><text x=\"358.0\" y=\"110.0\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-t\">Viertel <tspan font-weight=\"700\">nach</tspan> zwei</text><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"148.0\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-m\" font-weight=\"700\">2:30</text><text x=\"358.0\" y=\"148.0\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-t\"><tspan font-weight=\"700\">halb</tspan> drei</text><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"186.0\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-m\" font-weight=\"700\">2:45</text><text x=\"358.0\" y=\"186.0\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-t\">Viertel <tspan font-weight=\"700\">vor</tspan> drei</text><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"224.0\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-m\" font-weight=\"700\">2:50</text><text x=\"358.0\" y=\"224.0\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-t\">zehn <tspan font-weight=\"700\">vor</tspan> drei</text><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"270.0\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-a\" font-weight=\"700\">halb drei = 2시 30분</text></svg></div><figcaption>일상 시각 — 30분 전까지 nach, 30분은 halb, 그 뒤는 vor</figcaption></figure><p>시각을 물을 때는 Wie spät ist es? 또는 Wie viel Uhr ist es?라고 해요. 대답은 Es ist …로 시작해요.<br>공식 시각은 24시간제로 방송·일정·교통에서 쓰고, 일상 시각은 12시간제로 말할 때 써요.</p><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left t-first\"><thead><tr><th>시각</th><th>공식 (24시간)</th><th>일상 (12시간)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3:00 / 15:00</td><td>fünfzehn Uhr</td><td>drei (Uhr)</td></tr><tr><td>3:05</td><td>fünfzehn Uhr fünf</td><td>fünf <strong>nach</strong> drei</td></tr><tr><td>3:15</td><td>fünfzehn Uhr fünfzehn</td><td><strong>Viertel nach</strong> drei</td></tr><tr><td>3:20</td><td>fünfzehn Uhr zwanzig</td><td>zwanzig nach drei</td></tr><tr><td>3:25</td><td>fünfzehn Uhr fünfundzwanzig</td><td>fünf <strong>vor halb</strong> vier</td></tr><tr><td>3:30</td><td>fünfzehn Uhr dreißig</td><td><strong>halb vier</strong></td></tr><tr><td>3:35</td><td>fünfzehn Uhr fünfunddreißig</td><td>fünf <strong>nach halb</strong> vier</td></tr><tr><td>3:45</td><td>fünfzehn Uhr fünfundvierzig</td><td><strong>Viertel vor</strong> vier</td></tr><tr><td>3:55</td><td>fünfzehn Uhr fünfundfünfzig</td><td>fünf <strong>vor</strong> vier</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"callout callout-warn\"><span class=\"co-badge co-warn\">halb + 다음 시각</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">halb vier는 3시 30분이에요. '네 시를 향해 절반 왔다'는 뜻이라서 다음 시각을 말해요.<br>halb vier를 4시 30분으로 읽는 실수가 가장 많아요.</p></div></div><div class=\"dgm\"><div class=\"dgm-cap\">일상 시각의 기준점 — 정각, 15분, 30분, 45분</div><div class=\"flow\"><div class=\"flow-node\">drei<div class=\"flow-sub\">3:00</div></div><div>↓</div><div class=\"flow-node\">Viertel nach drei<div class=\"flow-sub\">3:15 — 정각 뒤 15분</div></div><div>↓</div><div class=\"flow-node\">halb vier<div class=\"flow-sub\">3:30 — 다음 시각 vier까지 절반</div></div><div>↓</div><div class=\"flow-node\" style=\"background:var(--accent-bg);border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent);font-weight:600\">Viertel vor vier<div class=\"flow-sub\">3:45 — 다음 시각 15분 전</div></div></div><div class=\"dgm-note\">25분과 35분은 halb를 기준으로 말해요 — fünf vor halb vier(3:25), fünf nach halb vier(3:35).</div></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">Uhr와 Stunde</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">Uhr는 시각(몇 시), Stunde는 시간의 길이(몇 시간)예요.<br>Es ist zwei <strong>Uhr</strong>. 두 시예요. · Ich lerne zwei <strong>Stunden</strong>. 두 시간 공부해요.</p></div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">시각</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> 2:30을 일상 시각으로?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) zwei halb</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) halb zwei</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) halb drei</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) dreißig nach zwei</button></div><div class=\"qe\">halb + 다음 시각 → halb drei.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> 'Viertel vor acht'는 몇 시?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) 7:15</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) 7:45</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) 8:45</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) 8:15</button></div><div class=\"qe\">8시 15분 전.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> 9:20을 일상 시각으로?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) zwanzig vor neun</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) neun zwanzig nach</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) zwanzig nach neun</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) zwanzig nach zehn</button></div><div class=\"qe\">정각 뒤 20분 → zwanzig nach neun.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> 'fünf nach halb sechs'는 몇 시?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) 5:35</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) 6:35</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) 6:05</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) 5:25</button></div><div class=\"qe\">halb sechs = 5:30, 그 5분 뒤.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> 공식 시각 18:45는?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Viertel vor achtzehn Uhr</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) achtzehn fünfundvierzig Uhr</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) achtzehn Uhr vierzigfünf</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) achtzehn Uhr fünfundvierzig</button></div><div class=\"qe\">Uhr는 시와 분 사이에 와요.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> '나는 매일 세 시간 일해요.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Ich arbeite jeden Tag drei Uhr.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Ich arbeite jeden Tag drei Stunden.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Ich arbeite jeden Tag drei Uhren.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Ich arbeite jeden Tag um drei Stunden.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">시간의 길이는 Stunde.</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-G\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">G</span><h2>시간을 나타내는 전치사</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">시각에는 um, 요일·날짜에는 am, 달·계절에는 im을 써요 — <strong>um</strong> 8 Uhr · <strong>am</strong> Montag · <strong>im</strong> Mai.</p></div></div><figure class=\"fig\"><div class=\"fig-scroll\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 236\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"시간의 전치사 — im은 달·계절·연도, am은 요일·날짜, um은 시각\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><defs><marker id=\"time_preps-ink\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mki\"/></marker><marker id=\"time_preps-acc\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mka\"/></marker><marker id=\"time_preps-ok\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mko\"/></marker><marker id=\"time_preps-no\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mkn\"/></marker><marker id=\"time_preps-w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mkw\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"12.0\" y=\"12.0\" width=\"576.0\" height=\"212.0\" rx=\"14\" class=\"f-boxs\"/><text x=\"32.0\" y=\"44.0\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-t\"><tspan font-weight=\"700\">im</tspan> — 달 · 계절 · 연도</text><text x=\"568.0\" y=\"44.0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"f-m\">im Mai · im Sommer · im Jahr 2026</text><rect x=\"40.0\" y=\"62.0\" width=\"520.0\" height=\"146.0\" rx=\"12\" class=\"f-box\"/><text x=\"60.0\" y=\"94.0\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-t\"><tspan font-weight=\"700\">am</tspan> — 요일 · 날짜 · 하루의 때</text><text x=\"540.0\" y=\"94.0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"f-m\">am Montag · am 3. Mai · am Abend</text><rect x=\"68.0\" y=\"114.0\" width=\"464.0\" height=\"76.0\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-boxa\"/><text x=\"88.0\" y=\"158.0\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-a\"><tspan font-weight=\"700\">um</tspan> — 시각</text><text x=\"512.0\" y=\"158.0\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"f-a\">um 8 Uhr · um halb drei</text></svg></div><figcaption>바깥 칸일수록 긴 시간 단위예요</figcaption></figure><p>'언제'를 말할 때는 시간의 종류에 따라 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">전치사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">전치사</span>명사·대명사 앞에 붙어 장소·시간·이유 같은 관계를 나타내는 말이에요. 뒤에 올 격을 정해요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: mit dem Bus · für dich</span></span></span>가 정해져 있어요.</p><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left t-first\"><thead><tr><th>전치사</th><th>쓰는 곳</th><th>예</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>um</td><td>시각</td><td><strong>um</strong> acht Uhr · <strong>um</strong> Mitternacht 자정에</td></tr><tr><td>am</td><td>요일 · 날짜 · 하루의 때 · 주말</td><td><strong>am</strong> Montag · <strong>am</strong> 3. Mai · <strong>am</strong> Abend · <strong>am</strong> Wochenende</td></tr><tr><td>im</td><td>달 · 계절 · 연도(im Jahr)</td><td><strong>im</strong> Mai · <strong>im</strong> Sommer · <strong>im</strong> Jahr 2030</td></tr><tr><td>in</td><td>지금부터 ~ 뒤 (미래) · 밤</td><td><strong>in</strong> zwei Tagen 이틀 뒤에 · <strong>in</strong> der Nacht 밤에</td></tr><tr><td>vor + 3격</td><td>~ 전에</td><td><strong>vor</strong> zwei Tagen 이틀 전에 · <strong>vor</strong> dem Essen 식사 전에</td></tr><tr><td>nach + 3격</td><td>~ 뒤에</td><td><strong>nach</strong> dem Unterricht 수업 뒤에</td></tr><tr><td>seit + 3격</td><td>~ 전부터 지금까지</td><td><strong>seit</strong> drei Jahren 3년째</td></tr><tr><td>ab</td><td>~⁠부터 (앞으로)</td><td><strong>ab</strong> Montag 월요일부터</td></tr><tr><td>von … bis</td><td>~⁠부터 ~⁠까지</td><td><strong>von</strong> neun <strong>bis</strong> fünf Uhr</td></tr><tr><td>gegen</td><td>~⁠쯤</td><td><strong>gegen</strong> acht Uhr 8시쯤</td></tr><tr><td>für + 4격</td><td>~ 동안 (예정된 기간)</td><td><strong>für</strong> zwei Wochen 2주 동안</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">전치사 없이 쓰는 시간 표현</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">heute 오늘 · morgen 내일 · gestern 어제 · morgens 아침마다 · abends 저녁마다<br>jeden Tag 매일 · nächste Woche 다음 주 · letzten Montag 지난 월요일 — 이 표현들은 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">4격<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">4격</span>주로 '~을/를'을 나타내는 자리예요. 동작을 받는 대상이고, für·ohne 같은 전치사 뒤에도 와요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Ich sehe den Mann. 그 남자를 봐요.</span></span></span>이에요.</p></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">in der Nacht</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">하루의 때는 am Morgen · am Vormittag · am Mittag · am Nachmittag · am Abend이지만, 밤만 in der Nacht예요.</p></div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">시간 전치사</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Der Kurs beginnt ____ neun Uhr.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) um</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) am</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) im</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) in</button></div><div class=\"qe\">시각 → um.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Wir fahren ____ Sommer nach Jeju.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) um</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) in der</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) am</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) im</button></div><div class=\"qe\">계절 → im.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Ich habe ____ Freitag frei.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) im</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) in</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) am</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) um</button></div><div class=\"qe\">요일 → am.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> '이틀 뒤에 와요.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Ich komme nach zwei Tagen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Ich komme vor zwei Tagen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Ich komme in zwei Tagen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Ich komme seit zwei Tagen.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">지금부터 ~ 뒤 → in.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Ich lerne ____ drei Monaten Deutsch. <span class=\"qh\">3개월째</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) ab</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) seit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) vor</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) in</button></div><div class=\"qe\">지금까지 계속 → seit + 현재형.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> ____ der Nacht schlafe ich.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) In</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Um</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Im</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Am</button></div><div class=\"qe\">밤만 in der Nacht.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Ich war ____ einer Woche in Busan. <span class=\"qh\">일주일 전에</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) seit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) in</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) vor</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) nach</button></div><div class=\"qe\">과거의 시점 → vor.</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-H\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">H</span><h2>가격 · 소수 · 분수 · 횟수</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">가격과 소수는 쉼표로 읽어요 — 3,50 € = drei Euro fünfzig. 횟수는 -mal을 붙여요 — zwei<strong>mal</strong> 두 번.</p></div></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" alt=\"3,50 € — drei Euro fünfzig 독일어는 소수점 자리에 쉼표를 써요.\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><div><span class=\"ph-de\"><strong>3,50 €</strong> — drei Euro fünfzig</span><span class=\"ph-ko\">독일어는 소수점 자리에 쉼표를 써요.</span></div></figcaption></figure><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left\"><thead><tr><th>쓰기</th><th>읽기</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>2,50 €</td><td>zwei Euro fünfzig</td></tr><tr><td>0,99 €</td><td>neunundneunzig Cent</td></tr><tr><td>1,00 €</td><td>ein Euro</td></tr><tr><td>2,5</td><td>zwei Komma fünf</td></tr><tr><td>½</td><td>ein halb · die Hälfte 절반</td></tr><tr><td>¼ · ¾</td><td>ein Viertel · drei Viertel</td></tr><tr><td>1-mal · 2-mal</td><td>einmal 한 번 · zweimal 두 번</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"exl\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Das kostet <strong>zwei Euro fünfzig</strong>.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">2유로 50센트예요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Ich gehe <strong>zweimal pro Woche</strong> ins Fitnessstudio.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">일주일에 두 번 헬스장에 가요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Ich bin <strong>25</strong> (Jahre alt).</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">저는 스물다섯 살이에요.</span></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">전화번호</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">전화번호는 한 자리씩 또는 두 자리씩 읽어요 — 0176 52 34 → null eins sieben sechs, zweiundfünfzig, vierunddreißig.</p></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-I\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">I</span><h2>가장 많이 하는 실수</h2></div><div class=\"trap\"><div class=\"trap-head\"><span class=\"trap-badge\">실수 1</span><span class=\"trap-label\">Fehler</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">21 이상을 한국어 순서로 읽어요</div><div class=\"trap-ex wrong\"><span style=\"color:var(--no);font-weight:700\">✕</span><span class=\"tx-b\">zwanzigeins<span class=\"tx-n\">십의 자리 먼저</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-ex right\"><span style=\"color:var(--ok);font-weight:700\">✓</span><span class=\"tx-b\">einundzwanzig<span class=\"tx-n\">21</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-note\">일의 자리 + und + 십의 자리, 한 단어로 붙여요.</div></div><div class=\"trap\"><div class=\"trap-head\"><span class=\"trap-badge\">실수 2</span><span class=\"trap-label\">Fehler</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">halb를 앞 시각으로 계산해요</div><div class=\"trap-ex wrong\"><span style=\"color:var(--no);font-weight:700\">✕</span><span class=\"tx-b\">halb drei = 3:30<span class=\"tx-n\">한국어 '세 시 반'</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-ex right\"><span style=\"color:var(--ok);font-weight:700\">✓</span><span class=\"tx-b\">halb drei = 2:30<span class=\"tx-n\">3시를 향해 절반</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-note\">halb 뒤에는 다음 시각이 와요.</div></div><div class=\"trap\"><div class=\"trap-head\"><span class=\"trap-badge\">실수 3</span><span class=\"trap-label\">Fehler</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">연도 앞에 in을 붙여요</div><div class=\"trap-ex wrong\"><span style=\"color:var(--no);font-weight:700\">✕</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Ich bin in 1998 geboren.<span class=\"tx-n\">영어식</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-ex right\"><span style=\"color:var(--ok);font-weight:700\">✓</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Ich bin 1998 geboren.<span class=\"tx-n\">1998년에 태어났어요</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-note\">연도는 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">전치사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">전치사</span>명사·대명사 앞에 붙어 장소·시간·이유 같은 관계를 나타내는 말이에요. 뒤에 올 격을 정해요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: mit dem Bus · für dich</span></span></span> 없이, 또는 im Jahr + 연도로 말해요.</div></div><div class=\"trap\"><div class=\"trap-head\"><span class=\"trap-badge\">실수 4</span><span class=\"trap-label\">Fehler</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">날짜의 서수 어미를 빼요</div><div class=\"trap-ex wrong\"><span style=\"color:var(--no);font-weight:700\">✕</span><span class=\"tx-b\">am drei Mai · am dritte Mai<span class=\"tx-n\">기수 · 어미 -e</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-ex right\"><span style=\"color:var(--ok);font-weight:700\">✓</span><span class=\"tx-b\">am dritten Mai<span class=\"tx-n\">5월 3일에</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-note\">am·im·vom·zum 뒤의 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">서수<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">서수</span>순서를 나타내는 수예요. 형용사처럼 어미가 붙어요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: der erste Tag · am dritten Mai</span></span></span>는 -en이에요.</div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">실수 피하기</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> 92는?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) zweiundneunzig</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) neunundzwanzig</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) neunzigzwei</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) zweiundneunzehn</button></div><div class=\"qe\">2 + und + 90.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> 'Es ist halb zehn.'은 몇 시?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) 10:30</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) 9:30</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) 9:50</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) 10:05</button></div><div class=\"qe\">halb zehn = 10시를 향해 절반 → 9:30.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> '그는 2010년에 독일에 왔어요.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Er ist um 2010 nach Deutschland gekommen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Er ist am 2010 nach Deutschland gekommen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Er ist in 2010 nach Deutschland gekommen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Er ist 2010 nach Deutschland gekommen.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">연도 앞에는 전치사를 쓰지 않아요.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> '8월 8일에'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) am achte August</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) im achten August</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) am acht August</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) am achten August</button></div><div class=\"qe\">am + 서수 -en, 8.은 achte.</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-J\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">J</span><h2>참고</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">층수</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">독일은 땅과 같은 높이의 층을 Erdgeschoss라고 하고, 그 위층부터 erster Stock(한국의 2층)으로 세요.<br>Ich wohne im dritten Stock. 은 한국식으로 4층이에요.</p></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">연도와 수량의 1.200</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">수량 1.200은 (ein)tausendzweihundert로 읽어요 — 1.200 Euro, 1.200 Einwohner.<br>연도 1200년만 백 단위로 zwölfhundert라고 읽어요.</p></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">지역에 따른 시각 표현</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">독일 동부와 남부 일부에서는 3:15를 viertel vier, 3:45를 drei viertel vier라고 하기도 해요.<br>시험과 표준어에서는 Viertel nach drei · Viertel vor vier를 써요.</p></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-K\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">K</span><h2>바로 쓰는 문장 · 일상 회화</h2></div><p>수와 시간으로 바로 말할 수 있는 문장이에요.</p><div class=\"exl talk-l\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Wie spät ist es? — Es ist <strong>halb drei</strong>.</span><span class=\"talk-pr\">비 슈페트 이스트 에스 — 에스 이스트 할프 드라이</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">몇 시예요? — 2시 반이에요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Um</strong> wie viel Uhr beginnt der Kurs?</span><span class=\"talk-pr\">움 비 필 우어 베긴트 데어 쿠르스</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">수업이 몇 시에 시작해요?</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Ich habe <strong>am zwölften Mai</strong> Geburtstag.</span><span class=\"talk-pr\">이히 하베 암 츠뵐프텐 마이 게부어츠탁</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">제 생일은 5월 12일이에요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Das kostet <strong>zwei Euro fünfzig</strong>.</span><span class=\"talk-pr\">다스 코스테트 츠바이 오이로 퓐프치히</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">2유로 50센트예요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Ich lerne <strong>seit drei Monaten</strong> Deutsch.</span><span class=\"talk-pr\">이히 레르네 자이트 드라이 모나텐 도이치</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">독일어를 배운 지 3개월 됐어요.</span></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"summary\"><div class=\"summary-card\"><h2 class=\"sum-title\">이 과 정리</h2><div><div class=\"sum-li\">0–12와 십의 자리를 외우고, 21 이상은 일의 자리 + und + 십의 자리 — einundzwanzig</div><div class=\"sum-li\">16 sechzehn · 17 siebzehn · 30 dreißig · 60 sechzig · 70 siebzig는 모양에 주의</div><div class=\"sum-li\">천 단위는 점, 소수점은 쉼표 — 1.000 · 2,5</div><div class=\"sum-li\">1100–1999년은 백 단위로 읽고, 연도 앞에는 in을 쓰지 않아요</div><div class=\"sum-li\">서수는 -te(1–19)·-ste(20 이상), 불규칙 erste·dritte·siebte·achte — am dritten Mai</div><div class=\"sum-li\">halb + 다음 시각 — halb drei = 2:30, Viertel nach/vor</div><div class=\"sum-li\">시간 전치사 — um 시각 · am 요일·날짜 · im 달·계절 · in ~⁠뒤 · vor ~⁠전 · seit ~⁠째</div></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\" style=\"margin-top:20px\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">다음 ⏭ 8과</span><div>8과에서는 '나의·너의·그의'를 나타내는 소유관사를 배워요.<br>소유관사의 끝은 3과의 부정관사 ein과 똑같이 변해요 — ein Hund → mein Hund · einen Hund → meinen Hund.</div></div></section><section id=\"solutions\" class=\"solutions\"><h2 class=\"sol-title\">Lösungen — 정답 모아보기</h2><div class=\"sol-grid\"><div><b>4–6과 복습</b>1. lerne · 2. Woher · 3. ihm · 4. nimmt</div><div><b>기수 0–99</b>1. siebzehn · 2. dreißig · 3. fünfundvierzig · 4. einundsechzig · 5. 78</div><div><b>100 이상과 연도</b>1. (ein)tausendfünfhundert · 2. neunzehnhundertfünfundachtzig · 3. Ich bin 2005 geboren. · 4. 3과 4분의 3 (3.75)</div><div><b>서수와 날짜</b>1. dritte · 2. zwanzigste · 3. am ersten · 4. der siebte · 5. vom dritten bis zum zehnten Mai</div><div><b>시각</b>1. halb drei · 2. 7:45 · 3. zwanzig nach neun · 4. 5:35 · 5. achtzehn Uhr fünfundvierzig · 6. Ich arbeite jeden Tag drei Stunden.</div><div><b>시간 전치사</b>1. um · 2. im · 3. am · 4. Ich komme in zwei Tagen. · 5. seit · 6. In · 7. vor</div><div><b>실수 피하기</b>1. zweiundneunzig · 2. 9:30 · 3. Er ist 2010 nach Deutschland gekommen. · 4. am achten August</div></div></section>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>\n"